Dialogue: 39,0:00:03.36,0:00:06.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nunca olvidaré esos días.
Dialogue: 39,0:00:10.99,0:00:13.32,AoHaru,,0,250,0,,{\an3}Primero de {escuela}secundaria, inicio del verano.{¿"Secundaria"? La verdad que sigo sin entender.}
Dialogue: 39,0:00:15.07,0:00:16.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,De camino a mi casa.
Dialogue: 39,0:00:17.85,0:00:18.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Una llovizna {lluvia pasajera}comenzó.
Dialogue: 39,0:01:16.18,0:01:18.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Comenzó así de repente, ¿eh?
Dialogue: 39,0:01:19.19,0:01:20.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Ajá...
Dialogue: 39,0:01:56.80,0:01:58.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka-kun, ¿irás al festival?
Dialogue: 39,0:02:03.71,0:02:07.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Me pregunto si Yumi-chan irá. \NMejor le preguntaré más tarde.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:14.01,0:02:16.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Toma, usa esto.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:17.85,0:02:18.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sécate el pelo.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:20.31,0:02:21.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sino te resfriarás.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:24.25,0:02:26.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Tu camiseta de deportes?
Dialogue: 39,0:02:26.03,0:02:29.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No te preocupes, está limpia. \NNunca la usé de verdad.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:30.28,0:02:31.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Una vez, pues.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:31.36,0:02:34.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡¿Qué?! ¡Entonces sí la usaste!
Dialogue: 39,0:02:44.02,0:02:46.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Está bien! La usaré igual.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:46.68,0:02:48.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Claro, adelante.
Dialogue: 39,0:02:49.26,0:02:50.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Gracias.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:00.17,0:03:03.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tanaka-kun iba en la clase de al lado.{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:03:04.16,0:03:09.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{He was short, and his voice wasn't very deep. Almost like a girl.}Era pequeño, y su voz no era muy grave. \NCasi como una chica.{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:03:11.98,0:03:13.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thank you.}Gracias.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:13.77,0:03:15.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Are you going to the summer festival?}¿Irás al festival de verano?
Dialogue: 39,0:03:17.24,0:03:19.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Have you already made plans with your friends?}¿Ya hiciste planes con tus amigas?
Dialogue: 39,0:03:22.18,0:03:23.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Not yet...}Todavía no...
Dialogue: 39,0:03:23.17,0:03:24.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Seven o'clock.}A las siete.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:27.87,0:03:30.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{By the clock in Triangle Park.}En el reloj del Parque Sankaku.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:39.18,0:03:40.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey.}Oye.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:40.32,0:03:44.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's going on with you and Tanaka? You dating or something?}¿Qué hay entre Tanaka y tú? ¿Están saliendo o algo así?
Dialogue: 39,0:03:44.03,0:03:46.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{C'mon, spill it!}¡Vamos, suéltalo!
Dialogue: 39,0:03:46.24,0:03:48.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just shut your mouth!}¡Cierra la boca!
Dialogue: 39,0:03:48.89,0:03:51.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{This is why I hate boys.}Es por esto que odio a los chicos.
Dialogue: 39,0:03:51.99,0:03:53.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Boys should just...}Los chicos deberían...
Dialogue: 39,0:03:53.71,0:03:55.47,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{...all die in a fire!}¡morir quemados!
Dialogue: 39,0:04:11.34,0:04:15.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{Seven o'clock, by the clock in Triangle Park.}A las siete en punto, en el reloj del Parque Sankaku.{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:04:15.94,0:04:19.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{The minutes passed by with no sign of Tanaka-kun.}Los minutos pasaban y no había señales de Tanaka-Kun.{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:04:21.08,0:04:24.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Seriously? Tanaka's gone?}¿En serio? ¿Tanaka se ha ido?
Dialogue: 39,0:04:24.20,0:04:26.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, I heard he moved away during summer vacation.}Sí, escuché que se transfirió \Ndurante las vacaciones de verano.
Dialogue: 39,0:04:26.94,0:04:28.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Could've at least told me.}Podría habérmelo dicho al menos.
Dialogue: 39,0:04:28.92,0:04:30.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What, you didn't know either?\fad(0,700)}¿Eh? ¿Tú tampoco lo sabías?
Dialogue: 39,0:04:32.45,0:04:35.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{He was as awkward as they came,}Él era tan torpe como se veía,{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:04:36.06,0:04:36.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}indeciso,{\i0}{100 líneas después me di cuenta que no dejé los cositos esos en la línea en inglés}
Dialogue: 39,0:04:38.68,0:04:41.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{and never sure of his place.}y nunca seguro de sí mismo.{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:04:46.63,0:04:50.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{But I was still in love with Tanaka-kun.\fad(0,300)}Pero la verdad es que aún estaba enamorada de Tanaka-Kun.{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:04:51.90,0:04:55.89,AoHaru,,0,0,90,,{\i1}{Even now, a small part of my heart belongs to him.}Aun ahora, una pequeña parte de mi corazón le pertenece.{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:04:58.07,0:04:59.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{Sometimes, I think,}Algunas veces pienso,{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:05:01.93,0:05:03.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{"I want to go back to those days."}"Quisiera volver a aquellos días".{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{Three years have passed.}Han pasado tres años.{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:05:19.71,0:05:22.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{I, Yoshioka Futaba,}Yo, Yoshioka Futaba,{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:05:25.13,0:05:26.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{live a peaceful life...}vivo una pacífica vida...{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:05:29.18,0:05:32.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mom! Why didn't you wake me?!}¡Mamá! ¡¿Por qué no me despertaste?!
Dialogue: 39,0:05:34.14,0:05:36.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{I'm about to start the third semester of my first year of high school.}Estoy por comenzar el segundo semestre de mi primer año de preparatoria.{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:05:55.25,0:05:56.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh no!}¡Oh, no!
Dialogue: 39,0:05:59.13,0:06:01.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba, morning.}Futaba, buenos días.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:01.00,0:06:04.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yo! Morning, Chie-chan!}¡Hola! ¡Buenos días, Chie-chan!
Dialogue: 39,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Here. Thanks for lending it to me.}Toma. Gracias por prestármelo.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:06.22,0:06:07.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No prob.}No hay problema.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:09.26,0:06:12.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Girl, you gotta take better care of yourself.}Oye{Nena}, deberías cuidar mejor de ti misma.{Yokc, hablo así aveces con amiwas, pero "Mujer" sería una buena opción aunque lo diría una vieja renegada )?}{No creo que se llame así (?}
Dialogue: 39,0:06:12.76,0:06:14.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're seriously lacking in allure.}En verdad eres muy poco femenina. {Me gustó como lo decían así en el mangu.}
Dialogue: 39,0:06:15.68,0:06:18.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{Don't think I don't know any better.}No creas que no lo sé.{\i0}
Dialogue: 39,0:06:18.23,0:06:19.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{This is all on purpose.}Esto es a propósito.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:20.86,0:06:22.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're hopeless, Futaba.}No tienes remedio, Futaba.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:24.44,0:06:27.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But that's what I like about Futaba!}¡Pero eso es lo que me gusta de Futaba!{Chie a Futaba}
Dialogue: 39,0:06:27.45,0:06:29.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yo! Morning, Asumi!}¡Oh! ¡Buenos días, Asumi! {low-joshiryoku speak in loud!}
Dialogue: 39,0:06:29.49,0:06:31.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're nothing like that.}Tú no eres para nada {\i1}así{\i0}.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:32.78,0:06:34.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Makita, good morning.}Makita, buenos días.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:35.37,0:06:36.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hello.}Buenos días.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:38.16,0:06:41.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hasta se les cae la baba solo con verla.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:41.00,0:06:44.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{She's not even all that pretty, either.}Ni que fuera tan bonita.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{They just like the idea of her. }Les gusta como "chica ideal".{Lo que estaba en inglés en esta línea daba a entender eso :v}{OK}
Dialogue: 39,0:06:48.72,0:06:51.97,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Makita Yuuri. Is she fine with the way things are?}Makita Yuuri. ¿Se sentirá cómoda con esta situación?
Dialogue: 39,0:06:51.97,0:06:56.02,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{All the girls in class hate and ostracize her.}Todas las chicas de la clase la odian y la marginan.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:56.02,0:06:57.64,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Just looking at her pisses me off.}De solo verla me hace enojar.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:56.89,0:06:58.77,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I wouldn't be able to take it.}Yo no podría soportarlo.
Dialogue: 39,0:06:57.64,0:06:59.81,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{She acts all cutesy in front of the boys.}Actúa muy cursi delante de los chicos.{\i1\¿"cursi"?\i0\}
Dialogue: 39,0:06:59.10,0:07:01.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That was my life the last two years of middle school.}Así fue mi vida los últimos dos años de secundaria.{Sigo sin saber... Hasta en el mangu le cambian la manera de decirlo.}
Dialogue: 39,0:06:59.81,0:07:03.27,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Yeah, right? Just because she's a little pretty...}Sí, ¿verdad? Todo porque es un poco bonita...
Dialogue: 39,0:07:03.27,0:07:04.44,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{She's the worst.}Es de lo peor.
Dialogue: 39,0:07:03.90,0:07:05.40,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I didn't want to be alone.}No quería estar sola.
Dialogue: 39,0:07:05.86,0:07:07.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{So I made my decision.}Así que me resolví.
Dialogue: 39,0:07:07.94,0:07:12.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{With the clean slate I received at high school, I remade myself as a brand-new Futaba!\q2}¡Rehice mi vida y comencé la preparatoria\N desde cero como una nueva Futaba!{Con la pizarra limpia>Desde cero comencé la escuela secundaria}
Dialogue: 39,0:07:12.20,0:07:16.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I wanted the girls to like me, so I took all the allure I had and killed it, killed it,}Quería que las chicas no me odiaran,\N así que me convertí en lo menos femenina posible, {Me gusta más así, es más como el mangu.}
Dialogue: 39,0:07:16.87,0:07:18.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{killed it!}¡matando todo mi encanto!{bueno...}
Dialogue: 39,0:07:18.08,0:07:21.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm starving! Let's go eat already!} ¡Muero de hambre! ¡Comeré ya mismo!
Dialogue: 39,0:07:21.54,0:07:23.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You sure love stuffing yourself.}Le encanta hartarse.
Dialogue: 39,0:07:23.04,0:07:25.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You blow my mind every day, Futaba.}Día tras día no dejas de sorprenderme, Futaba.{¿Quén habla así? D: "Golpeas mi cabeza todos los días, Futaba."}{Ç}
Dialogue: 39,0:07:28.09,0:07:29.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Tanaka!
Dialogue: 39,0:07:35.89,0:07:37.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Want some gum?}¿Quieres un chicle?
Dialogue: 39,0:07:37.39,0:07:40.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Come on, I told you to call me "Sensei"!}¡Oye, te dije que me llamaras "Sensei"!
Dialogue: 39,0:07:40.35,0:07:42.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So you want some or not?}Entonces ¿quieres o no?
Dialogue: 39,0:07:42.81,0:07:43.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Give it.}{Dale.}{"Quiero.", no sé, yo le hubiera puesto "Dame", pero quedaría como shaoi.}Sí.
Dialogue: 39,0:07:45.40,0:07:48.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What's this I smell? Love?}{¿Qué es ese aroma? ¿Amor? }{No sé, o miro mucho anime o en verdad dice "No me digas que... ¡es amor!", allá ustedes.}{<------------}No me digas que... ¡¿es amor?!
Dialogue: 39,0:07:48.40,0:07:48.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh?!}¡¿Eh?!
Dialogue: 39,0:07:48.99,0:07:54.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're not fooling anyone! You've never shown any interest in guys, and now you're going gaga over Tanaka-sensei!}{\q2}¡No puedes engañarnos! ¡Nunca te interesaron los chicos, \Ny ahora miras de esa manera a Tanaka-sensei!
Dialogue: 39,0:07:54.41,0:07:56.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, come on! I don't...}¡Oye, vamos! Yo no estaba...
Dialogue: 39,0:07:57.03,0:08:01.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We're just kidding. Love and you mix like oil and water.}Es broma. Tú y el amor son como el agua y el aceite.
Dialogue: 39,0:08:02.21,0:08:04.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, never in a million years.}Sí, ni en un millón de años.
Dialogue: 39,0:08:07.55,0:08:11.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Dude, don't you think Yoshioka from Class 2's kinda cute?}Oye, ¿no te parece algo linda Yoshioka de la Clase 2?
Dialogue: 39,0:08:11.01,0:08:12.93,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{No, stop it!}¡No, detente!
Dialogue: 39,0:08:12.93,0:08:15.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I guess, but isn't she...}Supongo, pero ¿no es ella...?
Dialogue: 39,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.39,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,¡Ahora, miren!{¿Está en italic hablando? Italic, bueh...}
Dialogue: 39,0:08:18.18,0:08:19.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey!}¡Oye!
Dialogue: 39,0:08:19.39,0:08:20.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The heck are you doing?}¿Qué estás haciendo?
Dialogue: 39,0:08:20.81,0:08:22.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, never mind.}Bueno, olvídalo.
Dialogue: 39,0:08:22.77,0:08:24.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{See?}¿Ves?
Dialogue: 39,0:08:25.23,0:08:27.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Did you hear those guys?}¿Escuchaste a esos chicos?{"Has oído...", luego me dicen cómo les gusta más y lo hago como quieran.}
Dialogue: 39,0:08:27.11,0:08:32.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba, I be you'd be drowning in boys if you cleaned up a bit.}Futaba, si fueras un poco más femenina,\Ntendrías un montón de chicos babeando por ti.
Dialogue: 39,0:08:32.32,0:08:35.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Please, like I care about that.}Por favor, eso no me preocupa.
Dialogue: 39,0:08:35.57,0:08:37.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You know I hate guys.}Sabes que odio a los chicos.
Dialogue: 39,0:08:38.41,0:08:41.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{As long as I've got you two, guys can all just—}Mientras las tenga a ustedes dos, los chicos bien pueden irse a—
Dialogue: 39,0:08:51.13,0:08:52.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What unflattering bread.}Qué pan tan feo.
Dialogue: 39,0:09:03.10,0:09:05.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Tanaka-kun?
Dialogue: 39,0:09:09.94,0:09:11.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Futaba, let's go.}Futaba, vamos.
Dialogue: 39,0:09:12.11,0:09:14.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There's something I forgot to buy.}Olvidé comprar algo más.
Dialogue: 39,0:09:14.90,0:09:15.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh?}¿Eh?
Dialogue: 39,0:09:18.12,0:09:20.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry, I'll be right there.}Lo siento, adelántense.
Dialogue: 39,0:09:22.58,0:09:26.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{His voice and height are completely different...}Su voz y altura son completamente diferentes...
Dialogue: 39,0:09:28.08,0:09:29.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I didn't even see his face...}No pude ver su cara...
Dialogue: 39,0:09:31.00,0:09:35.17,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Why am I so convinced that he's Tanaka-kun?}¿Por qué estoy tan convencida de que él es Tanaka-kun?
Dialogue: 39,0:09:50.94,0:09:52.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Mabuchi!
Dialogue: 39,0:10:02.37,0:10:04.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Mabuchi, buying lunch now?}Mabuchi, ¿comprarás el almuerzo?
Dialogue: 39,0:10:05.91,0:10:07.67,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,¿"Mabuchi"?
Dialogue: 39,0:10:07.67,0:10:09.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll tag along.}Iré contigo.
Dialogue: 39,0:10:19.51,0:10:20.97,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{It wasn't him.}No era él.
Dialogue: 39,0:10:24.85,0:10:28.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Good thing I didn't try to talk to him.}Lo bueno es que no intenté hablarle.
Dialogue: 39,0:10:30.02,0:10:34.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Though the fake Tanaka-kun did smirk when our eyes met.}Aunque sea un falso Tanaka-kun, nuestras miradas se cruzaron.
Dialogue: 39,0:10:36.11,0:10:40.45,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{And judging from his blue shoes, he's a first-year like me.}Y a juzgar por sus zapatos azules, él es de primer año como yo.
Dialogue: 39,0:10:44.12,0:10:45.58,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,No me lo puedo creer.
Dialogue: 39,0:10:46.54,0:10:49.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Why would I even think he was Tanaka-kun?}¿Por qué pensaría que él es Tanaka-kun?
Dialogue: 39,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¡Ah!
Dialogue: 39,0:10:59.43,0:11:03.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm not following you or anything! We just happen to be going the same way!}¡No te estoy siguiendo ni nada! \N¡De casualidad vamos por el mismo camino!
Dialogue: 39,0:11:04.10,0:11:06.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I-I messed up.}L-Lo arruiné. {Metí la pata.}{La cagué )?}
Dialogue: 39,0:11:20.49,0:11:25.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Really, I'm not following him. I just happen to live this way.}En verdad no lo estoy siguiendo. Yo vivo por aquí.{Debo tomar este camino.}
Dialogue: 39,0:11:28.37,0:11:30.54,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Huh? Just a minute here...}¿Eh? Un momento...
Dialogue: 39,0:11:30.54,0:11:34.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Wait, did he live in the same neighborhood as me?}¿Ah?{¿Qué?} ¿Vive en la misma zona que yo?
Dialogue: 39,0:11:51.10,0:11:53.35,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Comenzó así de repente, ¿eh?
Dialogue: 39,0:11:59.32,0:12:00.53,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I knew it...}Lo sabía...
Dialogue: 39,0:12:03.11,0:12:04.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I knew it!}¡Lo sabía!
Dialogue: 39,0:12:05.62,0:12:07.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I knew it!}¡¡Lo sabía!!
Dialogue: 39,0:12:14.25,0:12:16.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Ta... ¿Tanaka-kun?
Dialogue: 39,0:12:20.71,0:12:22.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{My name's Mabuchi.}Mi nombre es Mabuchi.
Dialogue: 39,0:12:28.64,0:12:31.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry! I thought you were someone else.}¡Lo siento! Pensé que eras otra persona.{"...que eras alguien más."}
Dialogue: 39,0:12:34.31,0:12:36.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Comenzó así de repente, ¿eh?
Dialogue: 39,0:12:59.34,0:13:01.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So you are Tanaka-kun!}¡Entonces sí eres Tanaka-kun!
Dialogue: 39,0:13:01.80,0:13:04.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Well, not anymore.}Bueno, ya no.{", ya no más."}
Dialogue: 39,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm Mabuchi Kou now.}Ahora soy Mabuchi Kou.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:08.26,0:13:11.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{After my parents divorced,}Luego de que mis padres se divorciaran,
Dialogue: 39,0:13:11.64,0:13:13.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{my name changed.}cambié mi nombre.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:15.19,0:13:16.56,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{His voice, his height,}Su voz, su estatura,
Dialogue: 39,0:13:17.77,0:13:19.90,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{and even his name have changed.}e incluso su nombre ha cambiado.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:19.90,0:13:21.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But still...}Aun así...
Dialogue: 39,0:13:22.23,0:13:25.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{The person before my eyes right now}quien está delante de mí ahora...
Dialogue: 39,0:13:26.41,0:13:30.91,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{is the first boy I ever loved.}es el primer chico del que me enamoré.{En el mangu dice "es el primer chico del cual me enamoré", podría variar por los traducs. del mangu, etc. Lo digo ya que es algo que repite varias veces en el manga.}
Dialogue: 39,0:13:32.49,0:13:38.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You didn't realize who I was for two whole semesters.}No te diste cuenta y pasó todo un semestre.{ya saben, ahora está en segundo según latam}
Dialogue: 39,0:13:39.00,0:13:41.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I knew you'd get it eventually,}Sabía que eventualmente te darías cuenta,
Dialogue: 39,0:13:41.30,0:13:43.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{but I didn't expect it to take this long.}pero no esperaba que pasara tanto tiempo.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:44.09,0:13:45.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Eres escandalosa.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:47.05,0:13:48.68,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Is this how these things usually go?}¿Así soy normalmente?
Dialogue: 39,0:13:49.30,0:13:53.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I recognized you right away, even with how you turned out.}Te reconocí de inmediato,\N aun con todo lo que has cambiado.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:53.56,0:13:54.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What are you implying?!}¡¿Qué insinúas?!
Dialogue: 39,0:13:54.98,0:13:58.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're certainly not the quiet girl I used to know.}La verdad es que ya no eres la chica tranquila que solías ser.
Dialogue: 39,0:13:59.06,0:14:03.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I-If you knew, you should've said something sooner!}¡S-Si lo sabías, debiste haber dicho algo antes!
Dialogue: 39,0:14:03.23,0:14:05.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And you've changed just as much as me, Tanaka-kun!}¡Y tú has cambiado tanto como yo, Tanaka-kun!
Dialogue: 39,0:14:05.69,0:14:08.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I told you, I'm not Tanaka anymore.}Ya te dije, no soy más Tanaka.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:08.36,0:14:10.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{My damn name's Mabuchi.}Mi maldito nombre es Mabuchi.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:11.12,0:14:14.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Geez... have I ever met such a scary person?}Qué miedo... ¿Conocía a alguien así?
Dialogue: 39,0:14:14.33,0:14:17.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Not like I'm one to talk...}Aunque no soy nadie para hablar...
Dialogue: 39,0:14:17.41,0:14:19.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Well, putting that aside,}Bueno, dejando eso de lado,
Dialogue: 39,0:14:19.58,0:14:22.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{wanna go for a reunion hug?}¿quieres un abrazo de reencuentro?
Dialogue: 39,0:14:22.54,0:14:23.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Come.}Ven.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:26.92,0:14:29.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No! Who even thinks of that?!}¡Ni en sueños! ¡¿Quién haría algo así?!{"¡Jamás! ¡Jamás haría algo como eso!"}
Dialogue: 39,0:14:29.39,0:14:31.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What do you mean, "come"?!}¡¿Y qué quieres decir con "ven"?!
Dialogue: 39,0:14:31.26,0:14:33.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I almost forgot.}Ah, es cierto.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:33.06,0:14:37.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You've always had it out for guys.}Siempre odiaste a los chicos.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:38.14,0:14:39.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I guess that hasn't changed.}Supongo que sigue siendo igual.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:40.35,0:14:43.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\i1\fad(300,0)}{Boys should just all die in a fire!}¡Los chicos deberían morir quemados!{\i0}{L:03:51:99/03:53:71}
Dialogue: 39,0:14:47.15,0:14:49.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, I hate them.}Sí, los odio.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:49.61,0:14:51.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Always have.}Desde siempre.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:51.95,0:14:52.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But...}Pero...
