Dialogue: 39,0:14:56.58,0:14:59.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're an exception.}eras una excepción.
Dialogue: 39,0:14:59.67,0:15:02.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I never got to tell you.}Nunca pude decírtelo.
Dialogue: 39,0:15:08.30,0:15:11.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So that's... how it was.}Entonces... así era.{Yo escucho "¿En verdad? Ya veo."}
Dialogue: 39,0:15:16.01,0:15:17.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Same here.}Pensaba igual.{Aquí... wut?}
Dialogue: 39,0:15:21.10,0:15:23.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I... really did...}Tú... también...
Dialogue: 39,0:15:24.77,0:15:25.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{...love you.}...me gustabas.
Dialogue: 39,0:15:30.70,0:15:33.74,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{This feels just like those days I've longed for...}Se siente como esos días que he anhelado...
Dialogue: 39,0:15:38.41,0:15:39.54,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I can go back...}Puedo volver...
Dialogue: 39,0:15:50.26,0:15:52.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We can never go back.}No hay vuelta atrás.
Dialogue: 39,0:15:55.55,0:15:58.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Things have changed since then.}Las cosas han cambiado desde entonces.
Dialogue: 39,0:15:58.02,0:16:00.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Both for you and for me.}Tanto para ti como para mí.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:02.27,0:16:05.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's all in the past now.}Ahora está todo en el pasado.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:10.19,0:16:14.62,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{This must be his way of telling me to forget about it.}Esta debe ser su forma de decir que lo olvide.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:16.95,0:16:20.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Come on, don't cry on me now.}Vamos, no te pongas a llorar ahora.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:21.79,0:16:22.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Stupid.}{Estúpida.}{"Idiota", me gusta más. Estúpida suena muy rudo. X( Pero en el manga también lo dice así.}{perryadapteron--->}Tontita.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:23.62,0:16:24.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Later.}Nos vemos.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:25.21,0:16:29.09,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Aunque, mientras decía esas palabras tan insensibles,
Dialogue: 39,0:16:29.55,0:16:32.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I heard a tinge of sadness in his voice.}noté un tono de tristeza en su voz.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:35.93,0:16:37.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Or at least I think so.}O eso es lo que creo.{"O por los menos creo que fue así."}
Dialogue: 39,0:16:45.06,0:16:48.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Back then, I didn't know.\fad(500,0)}En ese momento, no lo sabía.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:51.61,0:16:55.66,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I thought that I'd be able to talk it out with Tanaka-kun after summer vacation.}Pensé que sería capaz de hablarlo con\N Tanaka-kun después de las vacaciones de verano.
Dialogue: 39,0:16:56.70,0:16:59.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I thought there'd be plenty of chances to come.}Pensé que habría un montón de oportunidades.
Dialogue: 39,0:17:01.37,0:17:02.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But...}Pero...
Dialogue: 39,0:17:11.17,0:17:14.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{We can never go back.}No hay vuelta atrás.{Creo, o por los menos yo lo haría así, que esta parte en la que habla, al ser como un "recuerdo", debería tener otro estilo de línea, yokc.}
Dialogue: 39,0:17:14.84,0:17:17.22,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Things have changed since then.}Las cosas han cambiado desde entonces.{L:15:55.32}
Dialogue: 39,0:17:24.64,0:17:27.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Why does this bother me so much?!}¡¿Por qué me molesta tanto?!
Dialogue: 39,0:17:27.60,0:17:28.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Over here!}¡Por aquí!
Dialogue: 39,0:17:28.36,0:17:29.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Excuse me!}¡Discúlpame!{Con permiso.}{Escucho un "gomenasai" o como se escriba, pero no de que esté siendo dicho en voz alta xd}
Dialogue: 39,0:17:29.57,0:17:33.90,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{A sweet bean bun, a croquet, and a Danish!}¡Un bollo dulce de frijol, una croqueta y un{\fscx125} {\r\i0}danish{\i1}! {Hasta donde sé sería factura con algo en el medio o dentro, dulce de lo que sea, digamos. http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/Facturas_en_plato.jpg - http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0e/Pecan_and_Maple_Danish.JPG}
Dialogue: 39,0:17:33.90,0:17:35.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{That again?}¿Otra vez?{Son las voces de fondo}
Dialogue: 39,0:17:35.24,0:17:37.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Can you even eat all that?}¿Te comerás todo eso?{Puedes}
Dialogue: 39,0:17:38.12,0:17:40.87,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I know, right? Doesn't it disgust you?}Lo sé,{"¿Verdad que se ve raro?"} ¿verdad? ¿No te da asco?
Dialogue: 39,0:17:42.79,0:17:45.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wh-Who cares? It's my choice.}¿Q-Qué importa?{"¿A quién"} Es mi decisión.
Dialogue: 39,0:17:46.67,0:17:50.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{The only reason I overeat is to lower my allure...}La única razón por la cual como\N tanto es para no verme atractiva...
Dialogue: 39,0:17:50.59,0:17:52.50,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...but I can't say that out loud.}...pero no puedo decir eso en voz alta.{no puedo. xd}
Dialogue: 39,0:17:53.05,0:17:54.88,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'm so despicable!}¡Qué sinvergüenza soy!{No parece decir eso.}
Dialogue: 39,0:17:55.26,0:17:57.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Excuse me, these please.}Disculpe, estos por favor.
Dialogue: 39,0:17:57.30,0:17:58.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll take this.}Tomaré este.
Dialogue: 39,0:17:58.39,0:18:00.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure, just a sec}Claro, solo un segundo.{hai, hai hai.}
Dialogue: 39,0:18:01.56,0:18:04.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry, I'm all out of bags.}Lo siento, no quedan bolsas.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:04.22,0:18:06.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Give me a minute and I'll bring more out.}Dame un minuto y traeré más.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:06.52,0:18:08.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, don't worry about it.}Oh, no se preocupe por eso.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:08.98,0:18:10.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Are you sure?}¿Segura?{¿Estás segura?}
Dialogue: 39,0:18:10.44,0:18:12.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That'll be 530 yen.}Serán 530 yenes.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:13.28,0:18:15.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Good, exact change.}Bien, cambio exacto.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:15.36,0:18:18.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's see... Where's Chie-chan...}Veamos... ¿Dónde estará Chie-Chan...?
Dialogue: 39,0:18:18.45,0:18:20.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Where do you think you're going?}¡¿Adónde crees que vas?!{Le puse el signo de exclamación :B}
Dialogue: 39,0:18:21.07,0:18:24.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Are you trying to get away without paying?}¿Tratas de escapar sin pagar eso?
Dialogue: 39,0:18:24.70,0:18:27.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh? But I did pay.}¿Eh? Pero ya pagué.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:27.46,0:18:31.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't get smart with me. Those aren't in a bag.}No te pases de lista conmigo. \NSi no está en la bolsa no está pagado.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:30.63,0:18:32.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{Huh? Futaba?}¿Eh?{¿Qué?} ¿Futaba?
Dialogue: 39,0:18:32.34,0:18:33.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's because...}Eso es porque...
Dialogue: 39,0:18:33.67,0:18:36.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't give me that. I see you students do this left and right.}Claro que no.{No me vengas con eso.}\N Veo que los estudiantes siempre dicen lo mismo.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:36.63,0:18:38.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{No, I...}No, yo...
Dialogue: 39,0:18:38.09,0:18:39.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,¿Futaba?
Dialogue: 39,0:18:39.76,0:18:41.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Asumi, Chie-chan.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:41.64,0:18:45.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What do you think you're doing, Futaba? Are you crazy?}¿Qué crees que estás haciendo, Futaba? ¿Estás loca?
Dialogue: 39,0:18:45.97,0:18:46.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh?}¿Eh?
Dialogue: 39,0:18:46.31,0:18:48.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You gotta pay like everyone else.}Debes pagar como todos aquí.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:48.89,0:18:50.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm telling you, I did!}¡Te digo que ya lo hice!
Dialogue: 39,0:18:50.85,0:18:53.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Pay now and I won't have to tell the teachers about this.}Paga ahora y no le diré a los \Nmaestros lo que acabas de hacer.
Dialogue: 39,0:18:53.44,0:18:55.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{If you'd just listen...}Por eso...{Debes creerme}{No pega con el audio pero bueno. En todo caso "Pero/Pero yo..."}
Dialogue: 39,0:18:55.03,0:18:57.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{She already paid.}Ella ya pagó.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:01.74,0:19:02.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Excuse me.}Disculpe.{¿Obacha?}
Dialogue: 39,0:19:02.78,0:19:04.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yes?}¿Sí?
Dialogue: 39,0:19:04.16,0:19:07.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{She already paid, right?}Ella ya pagó, ¿verdad? {en el mangu no es tan así :_}
Dialogue: 39,0:19:07.00,0:19:10.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, she's good to go.}Oh, sí. Ya pagó.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:10.21,0:19:13.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Really? You should've said something sooner.}¿Eh?{¿En serio?} Deberías haberlo dicho antes.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:13.67,0:19:17.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Whatever... you can go now.}Como sea... puedes irte ahora.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:17.01,0:19:19.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Y-You...}T-Tú...
Dialogue: 39,0:19:19.51,0:19:22.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, where do you think you're going?}Oiga, ¿adónde cree que va?
Dialogue: 39,0:19:22.34,0:19:24.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Apologize, old hag.}Discúlpese, vieja bruja.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:24.43,0:19:26.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{"Hag"?}¿"Bruja"?
Dialogue: 39,0:19:26.22,0:19:29.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You messed up. You apologize.}Usted armó este alboroto.{quilombo e_e} Debe disculparse.
Dialogue: 39,0:19:31.56,0:19:33.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm so sorry.}Lo siento mucho.{~}
Dialogue: 39,0:19:34.02,0:19:36.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Uh, yeah... sure.}Ah, sí... claro.{... no hay problema}
Dialogue: 39,0:19:45.70,0:19:47.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey! Futaba?}¡Oye! ¿Futaba?
Dialogue: 39,0:19:49.41,0:19:51.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Tanaka-kun, wait up!}¡Tanaka-kun, espera!
Dialogue: 39,0:19:55.54,0:19:56.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What?}¿Qué?
Dialogue: 39,0:19:57.84,0:20:00.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Th-Thank you.}G-Gracias.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:01.13,0:20:03.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You really helped me out there.}En verdad me ayudaste mucho.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:04.30,0:20:05.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Whatever.}Da igual.{No fue nada.}
Dialogue: 39,0:20:05.60,0:20:08.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{She's the one who's got a few screws loose.}Ella es quien tiene varios tornillos flojos.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:08.60,0:20:11.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah. I was about to snap.}Sí. Estaba a punto de estallar.{explotar/estallar.}
Dialogue: 39,0:20:13.69,0:20:18.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But I felt better after you stood up for me.}Pero me sentí bien luego de que aparecieras para defenderme.{Déjenme vivir un shoujo ;_;}{NO}{ah}
Dialogue: 39,0:20:20.44,0:20:22.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's all it took to make you feel better?}¿Eso te hizo sentir mejor?
Dialogue: 39,0:20:22.82,0:20:24.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're so shallow.}Qué superficial eres.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:26.20,0:20:29.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And it's because you're like that that your friendships are shallow.}Y porque eres así es que\N tus amistades son superficiales.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:31.50,0:20:34.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's like you're all just pretending to be friends.}Es como si te gustara fingir tener amigas.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:36.54,0:20:37.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's pointless.}No tiene sentido.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:42.34,0:20:45.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It might look pointless to you,}¡Puede que tú lo veas como algo sin sentido,{inútil}
Dialogue: 39,0:20:46.43,0:20:49.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{but it's all very important to me!}pero son muy importantes para mí!
Dialogue: 39,0:20:50.14,0:20:52.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What? Just drop it.}¿Qué? No me importa.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:52.73,0:20:54.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I couldn't really care less.}En verdad no podría importarme menos.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:54.31,0:20:56.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's your business.}Ese es tu problema.
Dialogue: 39,0:20:58.06,0:21:02.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{First he saves me, and then brushes me off.}Primero me salva, y luego me trata mal.
Dialogue: 39,0:21:02.03,0:21:03.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I just don't get him.}Simplemente no lo entiendo.
Dialogue: 39,0:21:05.86,0:21:09.62,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Is he really the Tanaka-kun I once knew?}¿Es en verdad el Tanaka-kun que una vez conocí?
Dialogue: 39,0:21:10.20,0:21:12.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, and also...}Ah, y también...
Dialogue: 39,0:21:16.21,0:21:18.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{My name's Mabuchi.}Mi nombre es Mabuchi.
Dialogue: 39,0:21:24.93,0:21:27.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Tanaka Kou is long gone.}Tanaka Kou... quedó en el pasado.
Dialogue: 39,0:21:37.48,0:21:41.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Just as I've changed, the Tanaka-kun from my memories...}Al igual que yo, el Tanaka-kun de mis recuerdos...
Dialogue: 39,0:21:42.57,0:21:43.82,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...no longer exists.}...ya no existe.
Dialogue: 39,0:21:47.03,0:21:48.62,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I can't go back...}No puedo volver...
Dialogue: 39,0:21:51.41,0:21:52.74,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...to those days.}...a esos días.
